I see the issue - my battery is already at full capacity (10 MWh), so I cannot charge. Let me take the correct action.

Since I'm fully charged and the next blocks include a peak period (90 credits/MWh) followed by an evening period (60 credits/MWh), holding my 10 MWh will allow me to capture higher profits later. Discharging now would lock away energy that could be sold at much higher prices.

**Decision: hold**

